\newlabel{fig:bicbars}{{11}{19}{Two-panel BIC bar chart. (a) Ray-space BIC: the CMO telecentric family achieves the lowest BIC by a decisive margin ($>\num {40000}$~points). (b) Operational usability score with a \SI {1.5}{px} reprojection guard: models exceeding the threshold are marked as REJECTED (shown in grey/orange); only the 26p SE(3)-aligned model passes the guard (shown in green)}{figure.caption.15}{}}
